Content:
Fusemachines regained compliance with Nasdaq's minimum market value of publicly held shares requirement, keeping its common stock listed on the Nasdaq Global Market.

Key Highlights:

• Nasdaq notified Fusemachines on July 7, 2026 that it has regained compliance with Listing Rule 5450(b)(1)(C).
• The compliance relates to maintaining a minimum market value of publicly held shares of $15,000,000.
• Nasdaq indicated the matter is closed and Fusemachines' common stock will continue trading on the Nasdaq Global Market.
• The company filed a press release as Exhibit 99.1 to the Form 8-K announcing the compliance determination.

Original SEC Filing: Fusemachines Inc. [ FUSE ] - 8-K - Jul. 08, 2026

